<del></del></span> Recommended Gear for Shadow Priest in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="what-is-the-bis-shadow-priest-gear">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="$color" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_questionmark.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> What is the BiS Shadow Priest gear?</h3>With many different sources of gearing and loot scarcity in Mists of Pandaria Classic, targeting your absolute Best in Slot gear isn't entirely realistic; instead, we've created a Best in Slot list from the ideal Shadow Priest drops found in Phase 5 from raids, dungeons, Reputation, and World Bosses to help you decide what to prioritize.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>While raid drops are generally the most reliable way of getting high item level gear, many other items can be just as good, if not better, so you should reference the <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/classes/priest/shadow/dps-stat-priority-pve">Stat Priorities for Shadow Priest</a> to help determine your own BiS gear based on what is available to you. It is also essential that you should sim the different combinations of Haste-focused gems vs Intellect-focused gems to evaluate which is better.<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="bis-gear">Overall Best in Slot Gear for Shadow Priest</h3>This list represents the best overall gear available in Mists of Pandaria Classic Phase 5. It is essential to sim yourself as different pieces of gear become available, and reforge stats accordingly based on those pieces.<br/>
