<br/>These set bonuses don't change our spell priorities, but it is something you will have to keep tabs on during the encounter as it will increase the timers on your DoT effects and it does magnify the output of our rotation by increasing its damage output by a lot.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="legendary-cloak">
