<del></del></span> Legendary Cloak for Shadow Priest</span></h2>In Phase 5, you can at last finish the Legendary Quest Line and earn your Legendary Cloak. <a class="q5 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=102246/xing-ho-breath-of-yulon">
